         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_638ec43b-c122-393d-e053-2991aa0ab179">
               <id root="9491c27c-21af-9f82-e053-2a95a90a2260"/>
               <code code="34067-9" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph/>
                  <paragraph>Helps prevent sunburns. If used as directed with other sun protection measures decreases the risk of skin cancer and skin aging caused by the sun. 
  
       
 
  <content styleCode="bold">Sun Protection Measures: </content>Spending time on the sun increases your risk of skin cancer and skin aging. To decrease the risk regulary use Broad Spectrum Sunscreen with SPF 15 or higher and other protective measures including: limit time in sun, especially from 10am to 2 pm, and wear long-sleeved shirts, pants, hats ans sunglasses.
 
      

 </paragraph>
                  <paragraph/>
                  <paragraph/>
                  <paragraph/>
                  <paragraph/>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20180125"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_638ec43b-c128-393d-e053-2991aa0ab179">
               <id root="9491c27c-21b0-9f82-e053-2a95a90a2260"/>
               <code code="34071-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="WARNINGS SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph/>
                  <paragraph>For external use only. Do not use on damaged or broken skin. When using this product keep out of eyes. Rinse with water to remove. Stop use and ask a doctor if skin rash occurs.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20180125"/>
            </section>
         </component>
